MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_001: Hey, Guzran, can I ask you something?
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_002: Listen, Mu. I don't know where your dad is.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_003: I heard from my old mercenary pals that some kid\nwas sniffing around the taverns asking about Olunga.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_004: Uh, thanks. But actually...I wanted to ask you about\nthis rumor I heard about you and my mom.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_005: Basically, people are saying that Unkillable Guzran\ntrained Mikaela Redblade.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_006: Haha! I shoulda known! That's the story, huh?
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_007: I never heard anyone mention your name at home,\nso I didn't really believe it at first.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_008: Plus, you brag and drink and chase women, and my\nmom would normally hate someone like that.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_009: Anyway, the people who were talking about you\ntraining her... They didn't think the rumor was true.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_010: Haha! Sounds about right. No one ever believes\nthe stories about me.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_011: Wrong. I believe that story about you and Mom.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_012: Oh yeah? How come?
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_013: My mom is real tough. If some fake story was going\naround about her, she'd put a stop to it.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_014: Everyone says that story is a lie.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_015: But my mom hasn't squashed it. So...it must be true.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_016: Huh. I see.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_017: Now I get why she brags about you. She's always\nsaying, "My daughter's so much smarter than me."
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_018: I knew it was true! But how did you train my mom?!
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_019: What? Oh, that. Well, I said this thing to her, and she\ntook it to heart. Course I only meant it as a joke.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_020: I told her, "Real mercs train till they drop. But I do\nmy best training after it all goes fuzzy."
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_021: So she starts training so hard every day that she\npasses out...EVERY day! Ha! Got real strong though.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_022: Oh man, thinking about it now makes me laugh!\nHah hah hah!
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_023: {SetColor=Gray}Ugh, Mom... You actually believed his\nstupid bragging?{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_024: Hey, kid, take my advice... If you ever become\na merc yourself, don't do what she did.
MID_SE_Moo_Guj_C_025: I won't! I'm nothing like my mom!